$DATUM 1-Benzoxy-(3R,7R,11S,15S)-3,7,11,15-tetramethyl-4-(E/Z)-8-(E/Z)-decosa-4,8-diene
(23) (≤ 93% Stereopurity). Under argon, LiHMDS solution (0.5 M in THF,
7.2 mL, 3.6 mmol) was added in a dropwise fashion over 30 min to a
solution of
5-[(3S,7S)-3,7-dimethyltetradecanesulfonyl]-1-phenyl-1H-tetrazole (22)
(93% stereopurity, 1.56 g, 3.59 mmol) and
8-benzoxy-(2R,6R)-2,6-dimethyl-(Z/E)-4-octenal (17) (658 mg, 2.53 mmol)
in anhydrous THF (36 mL) at -78 &#x00B0;C. The reaction mixture was
stirred at -78 &#x00B0;C for additional 3 h and then allowed to warm to
rt overnight. The reaction was then quenched with saturated aqueous NH4Cl
(20 mL), and the aqueous layer was extracted with Et2O. The organic
layers were combined, and the solvent was removed. The residue was
purified by silica gel chromatography, eluting with 2% ethyl acetate in
hexane to give product 23 (≤ stereopurity). Oil, yield 925 mg, 78%. 1H
NMR (CDCl3/TMS) &#x3B4; 7.40-7.20 (m, 5H), 5.38-5.10 (m, 4H), 4.48 (m,
2H), 3.50-3.35 (m, 2H), 2.68-1.00 (m, 28H), 1.00-0.80 (m, 15H); 13C NMR
(CDCl3) &#x3B4; 138.85, 138.80, 137.3, 137.1, 137.02, 136.97, 136.55,
136.46, 136.3, 136.2, 128.4, 127.8, 127.74, 127.73, 127.6, 127.5, 127.41,
127.38, 127.35, 127.29, 127.2, 127.1, 73.10, 73.05, 73.03, 68.95, 68.94,
68.85, 68.82, 40.6, 40.4, 40.20, 40.18, 37.52, 37.51, 37.47, 37.4, 37.3,
37.21, 37.17, 37.15, 37.13, 37.06, 37.01, 36.98, 35.2, 35.0, 34.94,
34.93, 33.9, 33.6, 33.33, 33.31, 32.92, 32.91, 32.90, 32.4, 32.3, 32.1,
30.1, 29.5, 28.80, 28.79, 27.2, 24.7, 24.6, 22.8, 21.54, 21.48, 21.20,
21.16, 21.0, 20.8, 20.6, 20.3, 19.9, 19.8, 19.7, 19.6, 14.3; HRMS
(ESI/APCI) calcd for C33H57O [MH+] 469.4404, found 469.4407.
