$DATUM Our journey for the synthesis of (-)-cladospolide A began with the Wittig
reaction on D-ribose monoacetonide 15, using
ethyl(triphenylphosphoranylidene)acetate in the presence of a catalytic
amount of benzoic acid followed by protection of the resultant diol as
di-TBS ether afforded the compound 16 in 80% yield.
