$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Olefin (18) To a solution of aldehyde 2 (352 mg, 0.53 mmol) and sulfone 3
(324 mg, 0.53 mmol) in DME (15 mL) was added KHMDS (1.2 mL, 0.5 M soln in
toluene, 0.58 mmol) at -78 °C. The reaction mixture was stirred for 1
hour at -78 °C before it was warmed up to rt. The reaction was quenched
by sat NH4Cl (5 mL) at -78 °C and the organic layer was separated and the
aq layer was extracted with diethyl ether (3 x 20 mL). The combined
organic layers were washed with water and brine, dried on anhyd MgSO4 and
evaporated in vacuo. The crude product was purified by flash
chromatography (EtOAc/hexane 1: 20) to give the olefin 18 as a colorless
oil (393 mg, 70% yield). Rf value (EtOAc/hexane 1: 10): 0.48. [α]23 D =
+22.5 (c 0.55, CHCl3); IR (film, cm-1) 2857, 1729, 1612, 1513, 1257,
1081; 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.28 (d, J = 8.5 Hz, 1H), 6.89 (d, J =
8.5 Hz, 1H), 5.67-5.75 (m, 2H), 5.48 (d, J = 15.5 Hz, 1H), 5.41 (t, J =
3.9 Hz, 1H), 5.26-5.30 (dd, J = 15.5, 8.5 Hz, 1H), 4.96 (s, 1H), 4.89 (s,
1H), 4.68 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 1H), 4.44 (AB, J AB = 11.1 Hz, ΔυAB = 20.6 Hz,
2H), 4.40 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 1H), 4.34 (dd, J = 12.8, 7.1 Hz, 1H), 4.20 (dd,
J = 12.8, 3.9 Hz, 1H), 3.87-3.94 (m, 2H), 3.83-3.86 (m, 1H), 3.83 (s,
3H), 3.66-3.70 (m, 1H), 3.32-3.40 (m, 1H), 3.34 (s, 3H), 2.65-2.69 (m,
1H), 2.28-2.34 (m, 2H), 2.18-2.25(m, 3H), 2.10-2.14 (m, 1H), 1.83-1.90
(m, 2H), 1.70-1.74 (m, 1H), 1.72 (s, 3H), 1.60-1.65 (m, 1H), 1.53-1.58
(m, 1H), 1.49 (s, 3H), 1.40 (s, 3H), 1.21 (s, 3H), 1.08 (d, J = 9.7 Hz,
3H), 0.85-0.95 (m, 36H), 0.04 - 0.10 (m, 18H); 13C NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ
159.0, 143.6, 138.0, 134.0, 131.6, 131.4, 131.1, 130.0, 129.3, 127.3,
114.3, 113.7, 107.2, 93.1, 82.1, 81.5, 81.2, 79.2, 71.1, 70.8, 70.7,
59.8, 55.4, 55.2, 43.8, 39.7, 39.2, 37.5, 35.7, 35.6, 32.8, 29.7, 28.5,
26.6, 26.0, 25.9, 20.6, 20.4, 18.7, 18.4, 18.0, 15.5, 15.4, 15.0, -4.1,
-4.4, -4.5, -4.6, -4.7, -5.1; MS (ESI, m/z) [M+Na]+ 1081.7. HRMS (ESI)
[M+Na]+ calcd for C60H110O9Si3Na 1081.7355, found 1081.7367.
