12.5, -5.25, -5.30; IR (thin film): 2989, 2979, 2954, 2933, 2869, 1257,
1142, 1098, 1017, 836, 807, and 776 cm-1; HRMS calculated 537.4098
(C33H58O2SiNa+), observed 537.4074. (14d-Z): 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3),
identifiable, distinguishable, and diagnostic peaks of the Z-alkene: δ
5.14 (dd, J = 10.5, 10.5, 1H), 4.92 (dd, J = 10.5, 10.5, 1H), 3.44 (dd, J
= 10.0, 6.0, 1H), 2.64 (m, 1H), and 2.43 (m, 1H).
